  "details": "When using a station and the value of Upright is above 0.65, the body twist weirdly.\nBut entering a station with an Upright value below 0.65 will not do that.\nUpright 0.65 is the threshold when auto-footsteps turn on & off.\nWhen using a station, it should act the same way as if the auto-footsteps is disable in the avatar descriptor.\n\nA sync parameter could be added, so we could disable auto-footstep on the fly.",
